<title>USA: CCC seeks 4,620 T U.S. yellow corn for Guatemala.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 4,620 T U.S. yellow corn for Guatemala.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it would seek up to 4,620 tonnes of No. 2 or better yellow corn under its export program for Guatemala.</p>
<p>Offers were due on March 19 and the shipment dates were slated for April 3-27.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
